From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jimmyL <tliang92@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:51:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] acpc: Other option in elicitation forms

A select whose free-text companion the bridge names in
_meta["acpc/otherFields"] gets an Other option. The companion field is
only asked for once Other is picked, so picking a listed option no longer
leads to a text box, and each question counts as one field.
